#*
#*   Script Name:	tpIngestTar	
#*
#*   Purpose:
#*	Read the whole tape on the <device> and send the outpot
#*	to output_file.  The format of the output_file is
#*	tape_offset,	file_offset,	file_name,	size
#*	Log the status on status_file if the script is NOT success.
#*
#*   Date		: Jan 26, 1998
